  abilityDesc: 20 combo Dark attack on all foes (damage relative to remaining HP,
    boosts own critical rate), 12 combo Dark attack on all foes (damage relative
    to remaining HP, boosts own critical rate), boosts Dark elemental damage for
    3 turns, boosts Atk, Def, Rec (Dark) for 3 turns, probable 3 turns Atk, Def reduction
    infliction & probable 2 turns critical and elemental vulnerability infliction
